            "review_title": "Review at Sushi Wagao",
            "review_text": "Lee_N_76\nEindhoven, The Netherlands309 contributions\n0\nExcellent value\nFeb 2023 • Friends\nLast time I gave this place a 4 star because the then rather limited menu. They had expanded it since then. The nigiris are absolute steals, one fifth cheaper than nearby sushi restaurants but taste as good as in higher priced places in or near luxuirous hotels. The location is pretty close to the centre but on a very non tourist street. Thus it is packed with local people and if you showed up without prior a reservation on a weekend evening, chances are you will have to wait in line, outside the restaurant\nRead more\nWritten February 25, 2023",
            "rating": 5.0,
